# spell: the saved game, the party next to the monsters of cell 436 (combat.keys). The mage (AZALIS, member 3) has spells
# poked into its first level's slots (4 is magic missile); her book is in the second hand. Opens the spell panel with the
# hand cursor, moves its highlight, casts at the monsters; `wait`s let the missile fly and the burst play.
option save fixtures/EOBDATA.SAV
idle
mark load
key ENTER
idle
poke FBCA 468
poke FBCC 0
poke 7294 1
poke F890 0x0404
poke F892 0x0404
poke F894 0x0404
idle
shot start
mark cursor
key z
key z
key z
key s
shot hand
mark panel
key u
shot panel
mark move
key .
key .
key .
shot moved
mark cast
key SPACE
wait 60
idle
shot cast1
mark panel
key u
mark cast
key SPACE
wait 60
idle
shot cast2
mark panel
key u
mark cast
key SPACE
wait 60
idle
shot cast3
quit
